1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,484
Can wisdom be taught?

2
00:00:01,484 --> 00:00:06,041
Russell says yes, and that it should be an aim of education.

3
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:11,601
We are told on Sundays to love our neighbour; on the other six days we are urged to hate.

4
00:00:11,601 --> 00:00:19,908
The parable of the Good Samaritan made a despised foreigner the neighbour, but nobody hates Samaritans any more, so we miss the point.

5
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:28,320
To get it, Russell says, substitute Communist or anti Communist, the great hatred of the Cold War in nineteen fifty four.

